            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-11-28T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-29T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-11-27T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-28T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers, becoming less likely at night. Winds southwesterly 25 to 40 km/h. Daytime maximum temperatures between 19 and 22.</text>
